{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "afi-listen-tenant-auth-scenarios",
    "name": "AFI-LISTEN — Tenant + Auth (scénarios)",
    "description": "Couvre: system/public (header bon/mauquant/mauvais), préfixe path /slug/api/v1, login (tenant bon/mauvais), register + OTP éventuel.\n\n**Variables** : `goodSchoolSlug` = slug réel en base (ex. afi-default-school). `baseUrl` = http://localhost:3000/api/v1 ; `baseUrlPathTenant` = http://localhost:3000/{{goodSchoolSlug}}/api/v1 (nécessite app montée sur /:tenantSlug/api/v1).\n\n**Serveur** : pour « public sans header → 200 », mettre TENANT_STRICT_MODE=false + DEFAULT_SCHOOL_SLUG. Pour « → 404 », strict=true.\n\n**OTP** : si authOtpRequired + register renvoie REGISTER_OTP_REQUIRED, lire le code dans les logs serveur (MAIL_PROVIDER=console) puis exécuter « Register verify OTP » manuellement.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('uniq', Date.now().toString());"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('Standard envelope', function () {",
          "  var j = pm.response.json();",
          "  pm.expect(j).to.have.property('success');",
          "  pm.expect(j).to.have.property('message');",
          "  pm.expect(j).to.have.property('data');",
          "  pm.expect(j).to.have.property('error');",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "baseUrlPathTenant", "value": "http://localhost:3000/afi-default-school/api/v1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "goodSchoolSlug", "value": "afi-default-school", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "badSchoolSlug", "value": "ecole-inexistante-999", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@afi.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "fadeldev", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "otpChallengeId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. GET system/public",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "A — Header slug valide → 200 + schoolSlug",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.expect(j.data).to.have.property('schoolSlug');",
                  "pm.expect(j.data.schoolSlug).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('goodSchoolSlug'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-school-slug", "value": "{{goodSchoolSlug}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/system/public"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "B — Header slug invalide → 404",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 404', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(404); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "x-school-slug", "value": "{{badSchoolSlug}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/system/public"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "C — Sans header x-school-slug (strict=404 ou non-strict=200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Strict: 404 | Non-strict avec DEFAULT_SCHOOL_SLUG: 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 404]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/system/public"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "D — Path /slug/api/v1 sans header (non strict seulement)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Path tenant: 200 si path slug activé', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 404]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrlPathTenant}}/system/public"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. POST auth/login",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "E — Tenant correct + identifiants OK → 200",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.expect(j.data).to.have.property('token');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('goodTenantToken', j.data.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-school-slug", "value": "{{goodSchoolSlug}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\":\"{{adminEmail}}\",\"password\":\"{{adminPassword}}\"}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "F — Tenant faux (slug inconnu) → 404 avant auth",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('School 404', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(404); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-school-slug", "value": "{{badSchoolSlug}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\":\"{{adminEmail}}\",\"password\":\"{{adminPassword}}\"}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "G — Tenant correct mais mauvais mot de passe → 401",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Unauthorized', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(401); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-school-slug", "value": "{{goodSchoolSlug}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\":\"{{adminEmail}}\",\"password\":\"wrong-password-xxx\"}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "G2 — Login sans header (strict→404 | non-strict + DEFAULT_SCHOOL_SLUG→200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Strict: 404 | Non-strict avec défaut env: 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 404]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(j.data).to.have.property('token');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\":\"{{adminEmail}}\",\"password\":\"{{adminPassword}}\"}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Register + OTP (optionnel)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "H — Register (OTP ou tokens selon settings)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 register', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.data && j.data.step === 'REGISTER_OTP_REQUIRED' && j.data.challengeId) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('otpChallengeId', j.data.challengeId);",
                  "  console.log('OTP requis — challengeId=', j.data.challengeId);",
                  "} else if (j.data && j.data.token) {",
                  "  console.log('Pas d OTP — tokens retournés');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-school-slug", "value": "{{goodSchoolSlug}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\":\"tenant-scen-{{uniq}}@example.com\",\"password\":\"Testpass1\",\"firstName\":\"Test\",\"lastName\":\"Tenant\"}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "I — Register verify OTP (remplir otp depuis logs serveur si requis)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('otpChallengeId')) {",
                  "  console.warn('Pas de challengeId — exécuter H avant ou OTP désactivé');",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.test('OTP verify: 200 si code OK, 401 si otp factice', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([200, 401]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "  });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-school-slug", "value": "{{goodSchoolSlug}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"challengeId\":\"{{otpChallengeId}}\",\"otp\":\"000000\"}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register/verify-otp"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
